{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B1QnZCBJLauKF8XgCGP3wa","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"p\":\"my deep review run is stuck, /deep:review again\",\"attach\":\"/doctor:deep-loop\",\"typed\":\"/deep:review\",\"typedTop\":\"/deep:review\",\"asks\":false}\n{\"p\":\"don't run /deep:review, explain the review loop\",\"typed\":\"/deep:review\",\"typedTop\":null,\"asks\":false}\n{\"p\":\"what does /deep:review do?\",\"typed\":\"/deep:review\",\"typedTop\":null,\"asks\":false}\n{\"p\":\"see (/deep:review.md) for the flags\",\"typedTop\":null,\"asks\":false}\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/deep-loop-offer-cases.vitest.ts:31:  readonly typedReviewKept?: boolean;\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/deep-loop-offer-cases.vitest.ts:40:const typedCases = cases.filter((entry) => entry.typedReviewKept !== undefined);\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/deep-loop-offer-cases.vitest.ts:57:    expect(attachCommand('system-deep-loop', REVIEW_ROUTE, entry.prompt) === '/deep:review').toBe(entry.typedReviewKept);\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/python/test_skill_advisor.py:2872:            if \"typedReviewKept\" in case:\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/python/test_skill_advisor.py:2876:                if kept != case[\"typedReviewKept\"]:\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/fixtures/deep-loop-offer-cases.json:2:  \"$comment\": \"Shared deep-loop offer cases. Read by the TypeScript offer-gate test and the Python advisor test, so the native gate and the Python fallback agree on which prompts ask for a loop run, which complain about a stuck run and which write about the loop. asksForLoopRun is the full gate, after the past-run, stuck-run, write-about and question exceptions. typedReviewKept, where present, says whether a typed /deep:review keeps its command: attachCommand on a single review route in TypeScript, and the run row in the Python gate.\",\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/fixtures/deep-loop-offer-cases.json:118:    { \"id\": \"typed-refused\", \"prompt\": \"don't run /deep:review, explain the review loop\", \"asksForLoopRun\": false, \"stuckRun\": false, \"writingAbout\": false, \"typedReviewKept\": false },\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/fixtures/deep-loop-offer-cases.json:119:    { \"id\": \"typed-question\", \"prompt\": \"what does /deep:review do?\", \"asksForLoopRun\": false, \"stuckRun\": false, \"writingAbout\": false, \"typedReviewKept\": false },\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/fixtures/deep-loop-offer-cases.json:120:    { \"id\": \"typed-doc-path\", \"prompt\": \"see (/deep:review.md) for the flags\", \"asksForLoopRun\": false, \"stuckRun\": false, \"writingAbout\": false, \"typedReviewKept\": false },\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/fixtures/deep-loop-offer-cases.json:121:    { \"id\": \"typed-stuck\", \"prompt\": \"my deep review run is stuck, /deep:review again\", \"asksForLoopRun\": false, \"stuckRun\": true, \"writingAbout\": false, \"typedReviewKept\": false },\n1:223:## ADR-003: Waive AC-008 on the measured offer rate\n3:225-### Metadata\n7:229-| **Status** | Accepted |\n9:231-| **Deciders** | Operator, who chose \"Change to Waived\" on 2026-11-23 |\n15:308:- AC-008 reads `Waived` with `ADR-003`.\n17:310-**How to roll back**: set AC-008 back to `Met` with `-` in its Waiver cell.\n26:319-### Metadata\n29:449:| Q033 | Set AC-008 to Waived with the measured offer rates recorded in an ADR. | Not stated. | None | ADR-003, AC-008 |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:51:31.384Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"p\":\"my deep review run is stuck, /deep:review again\",\"attach\":\"/doctor:deep-loop\",\"typed\":\"/deep:review\",\"typedTop\":\"/deep:review\",\"asks\":false}\n{\"p\":\"don't run /deep:review, explain the review l