y:4521`), and `_LOOP_WANT_LEAD` (`skill_advisor.py:4522`). The mode-suffix list is copied the same way (`command-attach.ts:212` vs `skill_advisor.py:4627`). Nothing generates one from the other. The shared fixture and the predicate comparison catch drift only on the prompts they hold, and iteration 1's typed-command drift sat outside both.\n   Finding class: duplicated source of truth across languages.\n   Scope proof: both files are in declared scope.\n   Affected surface hints: command-attach.ts vocabulary arrays; skill_advisor.py _LOOP_REQUEST_RE, _LOOP_NAME, _LOOP_WANT_LEAD, _TYPED_DEEP_COMMAND_RE. A generated JSON vocabulary both read, or a test that compares the lists, would close it.\n   Case: a maintainer adds \"review sweep\" to LOOP_NAMES in TS. Python never learns it, and no fixture prompt uses the phrase, so both suites stay green while the degraded path withholds the offer.\n\n## Traceability Checks\n- spec_code (pass): the presentation offer section (`deep-review-presentation.txt:13-40`) and step 0 (`review.md:81`) match REQ-005: one question, A `:auto` recommended with the Gate 3 spec folder, B `:confirm`, C no loop, and the offer is skipped on a typed command or an attached suffix. The brief head in `injection-contract.md:56` matches 013 REQ-001 and REQ-006 and the `render.ts:250` string.\n\n## Edge Cases\n- A typed `/deep:review` with no suffix prints `(ask)` with no options. The command doc then takes the no-suffix ASK path (`review.md:86`) and not the offer, so the doc and the head agree.\n\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n- Offer wording is the same across the presentation contract, step 0 and the injection contract.\n\n## Ruled Out\n- A doc-to-head mismatch on the option labels: all three surfaces use A `:auto` (Recommended), B `:confirm`, C no loop.\n\n## Next Focus\n- Dimension: correctness (second pass, cross-cutting). Focus: the deferred and clarify route path with mode cues (`deferredLoopCommand`, `NAMED_LOOP_MODE`), and the stage-one rule in `explicit.ts` against the gate's loop vocabulary.\n\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL\nEOF\ncat > $L/scratch/iter4.json <<'EOF'\n{\"iteration\":4,\"focus\":\"maintainability: TS/Python vocabulary sync cost; offer doc vs brief head consistency\",\"dimensions\":[\"maintainability\"],\n\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:277\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:4529\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt:13\",\".skilled/commands/deep/review.md:81\",\".skilled/hooks/injection-contract.md:56\"],\n\"findings\":[\n{\"id\":\"O3-R4-P2-008\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The Python gate hand-inlines the vocabulary lists the TS gate keeps as data, so a list edit must be retyped into a regex\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:4529\",\"findingClass\":\"duplicated source of truth\"}],\n\"traceability\":[{\"protocolId\":\"spec_code\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"gateClass\":\"hard\",\"applicable\":true,\"evidence\":[\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt:13\",\".skilled/commands/deep/review.md:81\",\".skilled/hooks/injection-contract.md:56\"],\"summary\":\"REQ-005 offer section and 013 head agree across surfaces\"}],\n\"newFindingsRatio\":0.29,\"novelty\":\"One new P2 against 7 prior findings (weighted 1 of about 12); mostly confirmed-clean surfaces.\",\"durationMs\":200000,\n\"ruledOut\":[{\"direction\":\"option-label mismatch between offer docs and brief head\",\"reason\":\"presentation, step 0 and injection contract all use A :auto (Recommended), B :confirm, C no loop\"}]}\nEOF\nnode $L/scratch/record.cjs $L/scratch/iter4.json && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/012-deep-loop-command-offers --artifact-dir specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/012-deep-loop-command-offers/review/lineages/opus-medium-3 --create-missin