{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NFzXEQ8tbGWoos5ss4mFbE","type":"tool_result","content":"651:        extension_rule: \"When extension_pending == true, step_extend_completed_run has just set status initialized and appended run_extended, so a synthesis_complete row followed by an extended row is consistent: classify as resume, never as invalid-state or completed-session.\"\n1143:          set: { decision: \"STOP\", reason: \"maxDurationReached\", stopReason: \"maxDurationReached\" }\n1144:          bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"maxDurationReached\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"maxDurationReached\",\"elapsedMinutes\":{elapsed_minutes},\"maxDurationMinutes\":{config.maxDurationMinutes},\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation}}'\n1190:          - stop_decision: \"Tool stop_decision object: decision, stopReason, reasonDetail, weightedStopScore, signals, gates, blockedBy, graphDecision, inputs\"\n1219:          1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap is evaluated before every veto, the claim-adjudication veto included; failed legal-stop gates are recorded in stop_decision.blockedBy as synthesis evidence.\n1232:            stopReason = stop_decision.stopReason\n1233:            reason = stop_decision.stopReason when it is not null, else stop_decision.reasonDetail\n1267:          - reason: \"stop_decision.stopReason when set, else stop_decision.reasonDetail\"\n1341:              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error; blockedStop when decision is STOP and reason is blockedStop; else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n1346:            append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.terminal_gates_recorded\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\"},\"data\":{\"stopReason\":\"{terminal_stop_reason}\",\"gateResults\":{terminal_gate_results_json},\"failedRequiredGateIds\":{failed_required_gate_ids},\"appendPosition\":{current_iteration}}}'\n1353:              excluded_reasons: [maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached]\n1463:                      bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation}}'\n1507:                      bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation}}'\n1553:        action: \"Rewrite raw pause and recovery events to the frozen STOP_REASONS enum at emission time: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached\"\n1900:            set: { reason: \"error\", stopReason: \"error\" }\n2113:          - reason: \"Use the latest stop reason if present: read stopReason from the last line of {state_paths.state_log} with type === 'event' and event === 'terminal_gates' when it is newer than the latest stop event, since a manual stop is stored only there. On a fan-out root (direct lineage state logs exist and the root state log holds no such stop row): take each lineage that {state_paths.packet_dir}/orchestration-summary.json lists with status succeeded, and read the stopReason of the last row carrying a stopReason in {state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/<label>/deep-review-state.jsonl; when they agree use it, when they differ use the one whose row has the latest timestamp, since the run ended when that lineage stopped. Only when neither yields a reason, the frozen default 'converged'. (Must be a member of the STOP_REASONS enum: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached.)\"\n2429:        note: \"Every earlier reducer pass ran before closeout wrote synthesis_complete and before the status flip, so the dashboard would keep its pre-completion status. A fan-out root keeps no root dashboard.\"\n2534:      - \"/deep:review:auto \\\"{review_target}\\\" --spec-folder={spec_folder} --extend=N (when the stop reason is maxIterationsReached or maxDurationReached and dimensions remain uncovered)\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:54:07.725Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"651:        extension_rule: \"When extension_pending == true, step_extend_completed_run has just set status initialized and appended run_extended, so a synthesis_complete row followed by an extended row is consistent: classify as resume, never as invalid-state or completed-session.\"\n1143:          set: { decision: \"STOP\", reason: \"maxDurationReached\", stopReason: \"maxDurationReached\" }\n1144:          bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"maxDurationReached\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"maxDurationReached\",\"elapsedMinutes\":{elapsed_minutes},\"maxDurationMinutes\":{config.maxDurationMinutes},\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation}}'\n1190:          - stop_decision: \"Tool stop_decision object: decision, stopReason, reasonDetail, weightedStopScore, signals, gates, blockedBy, graphDecision, inputs\"\n1219:          1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap is evaluated before every veto, the claim-adjudication veto included; failed legal-stop gates are recorded in stop_decision.blockedBy as synthesis evidence.\n1232:            stopReason = stop_decision.stopReason\n1233:            reason = stop_decision.stopReason when it is not null, else stop_decision.reasonDetail\n1267:          - reason: \"stop_decision.stopReason when set, else stop_decision.reasonDetail\"\n1341:              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error; blockedStop when decision is STOP and reason is blockedStop; else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n1346:            append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.terminal_gates_recorded\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\"},\"data\":{\"stopReason\":\"{terminal_stop_reason}\",\"gateResults\":{terminal_gate_results_json},\"failedRequiredGateIds\":{failed_required_gate_ids},\"appendPosition\":{current_iteration}}}'\n1353:              excluded_reasons: [maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached]\n1463:                      bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation}}'\n1507:                      bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation}}'\n1553:        action: \"Rewrite raw pause and recovery events to the frozen STOP_REASONS enum at emission time: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached\"\n1900:            set: { reason: \"error\", stopReason: \"error\" }\n2113:          - reason: \"Use the latest stop reason if present: read stopReason from the last line of {state_paths.state_log} with type === 'event' and event === 'terminal_gates' when it is newer than the latest stop event, since a manual stop is stored only there. On a fan-out root (direct lineage state logs exist and the root state log holds no such stop row): take each lineage that {state_paths.packet_dir}/orchestration-summary.json lists with status succeeded, and read the stopReason of the last row carrying a stopReason in {state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/<label>/deep-review-state.jsonl; when they agree use it, when they differ use the one whose row has the latest timestamp, since the run ended when that lineage stopped. Only when neither yields a reason, the frozen default 'converged'. (Must be a member of the STOP_REASONS enum: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached.)\"\n2429:        note: \"Every earlier reducer pass ran before closeout wrote synthesis_complete and before the status flip, so the dashboard would keep its pre-completion status. A fan-out root keeps no root dashboard.\"\n2534:      - \"/deep:review:auto \\\"{review_target}\\\" --spec-folder={spec_folder} --extend=N (when the stop reason is maxIterationsReached or maxDurationReached and dimensions remain uncovered)\"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NFzXEQ8tbGWoos5ss4mFbE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChM9zUNwYJHLtxomXVDkv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011fpiKn2HoXnWJhzPrPRH3h","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n 1336,1352p .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml; grep -n \"synthesis_complete\\|deep_review\\.\\(synthesis\\|run_completed\\|terminal\\)\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/workflow-steps.cjs | head; sed -n 2383,2432p .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml","description":"Read terminal gate and synthesis steps"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2009,"cache_read_input_tokens":241508,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2009},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:54:13.501Z","request_id":"<redacted>","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_011fpiKn2HoXnWJhzPrPRH3h":{"command":"sed -n 1336,1352p .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml; grep -n \"synthesis_complete\\|deep_review\\.\\(synthesis\\|run_completed\\|terminal\\)\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/workflow-steps.cjs | head; sed -n 2383,2432p .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml","description":"Read terminal gate and synthesis steps"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011fpiKn2HoXnWJhzPrPRH3h","type":"tool_result","content":"            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n            bash: 'node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/terminal-gates.cjs --config-path \"{state_paths.config}\" --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\" --registry-path \"{state_paths.findings_registry}\"'\n            note: \"The script computes all three gates from the config, state log and registry: evidence by the evidenceDensityGate rule, coverage by the dimensionCoverageGate rule, and scope by matching every open finding's file against reviewScopeFiles. Never judge a gate from the findings yourself. Run it fresh at this stop, even when an earlier blocked stop recorded failures.\"\n            on_error: \"When the script exits non-zero or prints status error, fail closed: bind terminal_gate_results_json to three rows, evidence, scope and coverage, each with status fail, reasonCode gate-script-error and evidenceDigest the sha256 of the script's error text, and bind failed_required_gate_ids to [\\\"evidence\\\",\\\"scope\\\",\\\"coverage\\\"].\"\n            evaluate: |\n              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error; blockedStop when decision is STOP and reason is blockedStop; else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n            outputs:\n              - terminal_gate_results_json: \"Tool terminal_gate_results_json: three rows {gateId, status, reasonCode, evidenceDigest} in the order evidence, scope, coverage\"\n              - failed_required_gate_ids: \"Tool failed_required_gate_ids: the gateIds whose status is fail, in that order; [] when all pass\"\n              - terminal_stop_reason: \"From evaluate\"\n            append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.terminal_gates_recorded\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\"},\"data\":{\"stopReason\":\"{terminal_stop_reason}\",\"gateResults\":{terminal_gate_results_json},\"failedRequiredGateIds\":{failed_required_gate_ids},\"appendPosition\":{current_iteration}}}'\n            log: \"Terminal gates recorded at stop {terminal_stop_reason}. Failed required gates: {failed_required_gate_ids}\"\n          branch_on: \"convergence_mode == 'divergent' AND stop_decision.reasonDetail == 'all_dimensions_clean'\"\n          if_divergent_eligible:\n            eligibility_contract:\n              required_decision: \"STOP\"\n              eligible_reasons: [all_dimensions_clean]\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml:651:        extension_rule: \"When extension_pending == true, step_extend_completed_run has just set status initialized and appended run_extended, so a synthesis_complete row followed by an extended row is consistent: classify as resume, never as invalid-state or completed-session.\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml:1346:            append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.terminal_gates_recorded\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\"},\"data\":{\"stopReason\":\"{terminal_stop_reason}\",\"gateResults\":{terminal_gate_results_json},\"failedRequiredGateIds\":{failed_required_gate_ids},\"appendPosition\":{current_iteration}}}'\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml:2429:        note: \"Every earlier reducer pass ran before closeout wrote synthesis_complete and before the status flip, so the dashboard would keep its pre-completion status. A fan-out root keeps no root dashboard.\"\n      step_convergence_report:\n        action: \"Append convergence report to JSONL\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"state-mutation\"\n        command: |\n          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n          EVENT_DIR=\"$(mktemp -d \"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/deep-review-synthesis.XXXXXX\")\"\n          CLOSEOUT=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n          [ -f \"$CLOSEOUT\" ] || CLOSEOUT=\"scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n          node \"$CLOSEOUT\" --mode review --event-dir \"$EVENT_DIR\" \\\n            --artifact-dir \"{state_paths.packet_dir}\" \\\n            --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\" \\\n            --registry \"{state_paths.findings_registry}\" \\\n            --output \"{state_paths.review_output}\" \\\n            --dashboard \"{state_paths.dashboard}\" \\\n            --stop-reason \"{reason}\" \\\n            --active-p0 \"{active_p0}\" --active-p1 \"{active_p1}\" --active-p2 \"{active_p2}\" \\\n            --dimension-coverage \"{dimension_coverage}\" \\\n            --verdict \"{verdict}\" \\\n            --release-readiness-state \"{release_readiness_state}\"\n          NODE_STATUS=$?\n          for eventFile in \"$EVENT_DIR\"/*.json; do\n            [ -e \"$eventFile\" ] || continue\n            node \"$GATEWAY\" --mode review --run-directory \"$(dirname \"{state_paths.state_log}\")\" --event-json \"$eventFile\"\n            GATEWAY_STATUS=$?\n            if [ \"$GATEWAY_STATUS\" -ne 0 ]; then\n              rm -rf \"$EVENT_DIR\"\n              exit \"$GATEWAY_STATUS\"\n            fi\n          done\n          rm -rf \"$EVENT_DIR\"\n          exit \"$NODE_STATUS\"\n        note: \"Emit as numeric ratio (e.g., 0.75), not quoted string. Compute: dimensions_covered / total_dimensions.\"\n\n      step_update_config_status:\n        action: \"Mark config as complete\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"state-mutation\"\n        edit: \"{state_paths.config}\"\n        set_field: { status: \"complete\" }\n\n      step_refresh_completed_dashboard:\n        action: \"Rerun the reducer so the dashboard reports the completed status\"\n        skip_when: \"config.fanout is present\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"reducer-refresh\"\n        command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\"\n        working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n        note: \"Every earlier reducer pass ran before closeout wrote synthesis_complete and before the status flip, so the dashboard would keep its pre-completion status. A fan-out root keeps no root dashboard.\"\n        on_failure: \"Log the stderr line as a warning and continue. The run is already complete; only the dashboard status line stays stale.\"\n\n      step_stage_artifact_dir:","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:54:13.772Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n            bash: 'node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/terminal-gates.cjs --config-path \"{state_paths.config}\" --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\" --registry-path \"{state_paths.findings_registry}\"'\n            note: \"The script computes all three gates from the config, state log and registry: evidence by the evidenceDensityGate rule, coverage by the dimensionCoverageGate rule, and scope by matching every open finding's file against reviewScopeFiles. Never judge a gate from the findings yourself. Run it fresh at this stop, even when an earlier blocked stop recorded failures.\"\n            on_error: \"When the script exits non-zero or prints status error, fail closed: bind terminal_gate_results_json to three rows, evidence, scope and coverage, each with status fail, reasonCode gate-script-error and evidenceDigest the sha256 of the script's error text, and bind failed_required_gate_ids to [\\\"evidence\\\",\\\"scope\\\",\\\"coverage\\\"].\"\n            evaluate: |\n              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error; blockedStop when decision is STOP and reason is blockedStop; else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n            outputs:\n              - terminal_gate_results_json: \"Tool terminal_gate_results_json: three rows {gateId, status, reasonCode, evidenceDigest} in the order evidence, scope, coverage\"\n              - failed_required_gate_ids: \"Tool failed_required_gate_ids: the gateIds whose status is fail, in that order; [] when all pass\"\n              - terminal_stop_reason: \"From evaluate\"\n            append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.terminal_gates_recorded\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\"},\"data\":{\"stopReason\":\"{terminal_stop_reason}\",\"gateResults\":{terminal_gate_results_json},\"failedRequiredGateIds\":{failed_required_gate_ids},\"appendPosition\":{current_iteration}}}'\n            log: \"Terminal gates recorded at stop {terminal_stop_reason}. Failed required gates: {failed_required_gate_ids}\"\n          branch_on: \"convergence_mode == 'divergent' AND stop_decision.reasonDetail == 'all_dimensions_clean'\"\n          if_divergent_eligible:\n            eligibility_contract:\n              required_decision: \"STOP\"\n              eligible_reasons: [all_dimensions_clean]\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml:651:        extension_rule: \"When extension_pending == true, step_extend_completed_run has just set status initialized and appended run_extended, so a synthesis_complete row followed by an extended row is consistent: classify as resume, never as invalid-state or completed-session.\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml:1346:            append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.terminal_gates_recorded\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\"},\"data\":{\"stopReason\":\"{terminal_stop_reason}\",\"gateResults\":{terminal_gate_results_json},\"failedRequiredGateIds\":{failed_required_gate_ids},\"appendPosition\":{current_iteration}}}'\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml:2429:        note: \"Every earlier reducer pass ran before closeout wrote synthesis_complete and before the status flip, so the dashboard would keep its pre-completion status. A fan-out root keeps no root dashboard.\"\n      step_convergence_report:\n        action: \"Append convergence report to JSONL\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"state-mutation\"\n        command: |\n          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n          EVENT_DIR=\"$(mktemp -d \"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/deep-review-synthesis.XXXXXX\")\"\n          CLOSEOUT=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n          [ -f \"$CLOSEOUT\" ] || CLOSEOUT=\"scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n          node \"$CLOSEOUT\" --mode review --event-dir \"$EVENT_DIR\" \\\n            --artifact-dir \"{state_paths.packet_dir}\" \\\n            --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\" \\\n            --registry \"{state_paths.findings_registry}\" \\\n            --output \"{state_paths.review_output}\" \\\n            --dashboard \"{state_paths.dashboard}\" \\\n            --stop-reason \"{reason}\" \\\n            --active-p0 \"{active_p0}\" --active-p1 \"{active_p1}\" --active-p2 \"{active_p2}\" \\\n            --dimension-coverage \"{dimension_coverage}\" \\\n            --verdict \"{verdict}\" \\\n            --release-readiness-state \"{release_readiness_state}\"\n          NODE_STATUS=$?\n          for eventFile in \"$EVENT_DIR\"/*.json; do\n            [ -e \"$eventFile\" ] || continue\n            node \"$GATEWAY\" --mode review --run-directory \"$(dirname \"{state_paths.state_log}\")\" --event-json \"$eventFile\"\n            GATEWAY_STATUS=$?\n            if [ \"$GATEWAY_STATUS\" -ne 0 ]; then\n              rm -rf \"$EVENT_DIR\"\n              exit \"$GATEWAY_STATUS\"\n            fi\n          done\n          rm -rf \"$EVENT_DIR\"\n          exit \"$NODE_STATUS\"\n        note: \"Emit as numeric ratio (e.g., 0.75), not quoted string. Compute: dimensions_covered / total_dimensions.\"\n\n      step_update_config_status:\n        action: \"Mark config as complete\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"state-mutation\"\n        edit: \"{state_paths.config}\"\n        set_field: { status: \"complete\" }\n\n      step_refresh_completed_dashboard:\n        action: \"Rerun the reducer so the dashboard reports the completed status\"\n        skip_when: \"config.fanout is present\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"reducer-refresh\"\n        command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\"\n        working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n        note: \"Every earlier reducer pass ran before closeout wrote synthesis_complete and before the status flip, so the dashboard would keep its pre-completion status. A fan-out root keeps no root dashboard.\"\n        on_failure: \"Log the stderr line as a warning and continue. The run is already complete; only the dashboard status line stays stale.\"\n\n      step_stage_artifact_dir:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011fpiKn2HoXnWJhzPrPRH3h","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
